       "K0023",
       "K0033",
       "K0035"
      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "From what I know and hear, Clara, Margaret, Marta, Tomas and Viktor owe Oskar money \u2014 Clara and Marta are behind with it.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:oskar",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
