       "K0034",
       "K0036",
       "K0047",
       "K0055"
      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "I saw Marta ask Oskar and Tomas for money a while ago and get turned down.",
      "time": 61013,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:marta"
      ]
     },
     {
