      "text": "At the Grey Heron, from about 18:00 to 20:00 on Day 49, I saw Clara, Elias, Lena, Margaret, Marta, Oskar, Ruth, Tomas and Viktor, coming and going; Marta and Oskar were the worse for drink.",
