      "key": "K0083",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 49: from about 18:30 to 21:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 21:02 I passed through the square; around 21:04 I passed through Mill Road; from about 21:00 to 21:30 I was at home.",
      "time": 70224,
