      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Grey Heron, from about 18:00 to 22:00 on Day 49, I saw Arvid, Clara, Lena, Margaret, Marta, Oskar, Ruth, Tomas and Viktor, coming and going; Marta, Oskar and Viktor were the worse for drink.",
