       "K0309"
      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "From what I know and hear, Arvid, Clara, Margaret, Marta, Tomas and Viktor owe Oskar money \u2014 Arvid, Clara and Viktor are behind with it.",
