      "text": "At the Grey Heron, from about 17:00 to 23:00 on Day 49, I saw Arvid, Clara, Elias, Margaret, Marta, Oskar, Ruth, Tomas and Viktor, coming and going; Elias, Marta, Oskar, Ruth and Viktor were the worse for drink.",
