      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Grey Heron, from about 17:00 to 21:00 on Day 49, I saw Arvid, Clara, Elias, Lena, Marta, Oskar, Ruth, Tomas and Viktor, coming and going; Marta and Oskar were the worse for drink.",
