      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Grey Heron, from about 17:00 to 22:00 on Day 49, I saw Arvid, Clara, Elias, Lena, Margaret, Marta, Ruth, Tomas and Viktor, coming and going; Elias, Ruth and Viktor were the worse for drink.",
